{:edb/db-before-t 2884 :edb/db-after-t 2885 :edb/tx-data [[13194139536197 50 #inst "2026-10-09T19:47:31.009Z" 13194139536197 true] [17592186152198 1020 #edb/ref 17592186388425 13194139536197 true] [17592186152198 1020 #edb/ref 17592186388432 13194139536197 true] [17592186152198 1020 #edb/ref 17592186388487 13194139536197 true] [17592186152199 1020 #edb/ref 17592186388453 13194139536197 true] [17592186152199 1020 #edb/ref 17592186388463 13194139536197 true] [17592186152200 1020 #edb/ref 17592186388439 13194139536197 true] [17592186152200 1020 #edb/ref 17592186388446 13194139536197 true] [17592186152200 1020 #edb/ref 17592186388494 13194139536197 true] [17592186152200 1020 #edb/ref 17592186388501 13194139536197 true] [17592186152200 1020 #edb/ref 17592186388508 13194139536197 true] [17592186152201 1020 #edb/ref 17592186388473 13194139536197 true] [17592186152201 1020 #edb/ref 17592186388480 13194139536197 true] [17592186388425 1017 #edb/ref 17592186388426 13194139536197 true] [17592186388425 1089 "q-130670" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388425 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536197 true] [17592186388425 1100 "Which of the following second-order differential equations are linear?\n\n- $2{y}^{″}+(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x){y}^{′}-y=1$\n- ${y}^{″}+y{y}^{′}+{e}^{x}y=0$\n- $x{y}^{″}+{x}^{2}y={e}^{x}$" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388425 1113 #uuid "9e02865a-5c8d-59a5-b60c-4dc61a1f54cf" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388425 1145 "А second-order linear differential equation has the form\n\n$$\na(x){y}^{″}+b(x){y}^{′}+c(x)y=f(x).\n$$\n\nLet's look at each equation in turn.\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\n2{y}^{″}+(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x){y}^{′}-y=1\n$$\n\nis a second-order linear ODE with $a(x)=2,b(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x,c(x)=-1,$ and $f(x)=1.$\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+y{y}^{′}+{e}^{x}y=0\n$$\n\nis **NOT** linear because it contains the nonlinear term $y{y}^{′}.$\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\nx{y}^{″}+{x}^{2}y={e}^{x}\n$$\n\nis a second-order linear ODE with $a(x)=x,b(x)=0,c(x)={x}^{2},$ and $f(x)={e}^{x}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388426 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388427 13194139536197 true] [17592186388426 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388428 13194139536197 true] [17592186388426 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388429 13194139536197 true] [17592186388426 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388430 13194139536197 true] [17592186388426 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388431 13194139536197 true] [17592186388426 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536197 true] [17592186388426 1041 "selection" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388426 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388428 13194139536197 true] [17592186388426 1110 #uuid "9b498458-1211-55f1-a377-d1feeb14a65b" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388427 1034 "II and III only" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388427 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536197 true] [17592186388427 1111 #uuid "e7adc37d-388e-504b-8308-68d35a0c3f7c" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388428 1034 "I and III only" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388428 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536197 true] [17592186388428 1111 #uuid "8b9a7ccb-a6b9-56e9-a827-933c59d3317e" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388429 1034 "I only" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388429 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536197 true] [17592186388429 1111 #uuid "dd956161-9bbf-50bc-b1ca-a04c91195ddb" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388430 1034 "III only" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388430 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536197 true] [17592186388430 1111 #uuid "a68c29a5-d903-5575-ac88-48882c10bbc9" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388431 1034 "I and II only" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388431 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536197 true] [17592186388431 1111 #uuid "9f907570-32c5-5a61-a451-65ce524675e9" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388432 1017 #edb/ref 17592186388433 13194139536197 true] [17592186388432 1089 "q-130677" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388432 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536197 true] [17592186388432 1100 "Which of the following second-order differential equations are linear?\n\n- $2{x}^{2}{y}^{″}-\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\,{y}^{′}+{y}^{2}=0$\n- $2{y}^{″}+{x}^{3}{y}^{′}+2xy=0$\n- ${y}^{″}+x{y}^{′}=x{e}^{x}$" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388432 1113 #uuid "39f9da72-d680-558d-9f90-b3e43effce25" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388432 1145 "А second-order linear differential equation has the form\n\n$$\na(x){y}^{″}+b(x){y}^{′}+c(x)y=f(x).\n$$\n\nLet's look at each equation in turn.\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\n2{x}^{2}{y}^{″}-\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\,{y}^{′}+{y}^{2}=0\n$$\n\nis **NOT** linear because it contains the nonlinear term ${y}^{2}.$\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\n2{y}^{″}+{x}^{3}{y}^{′}+2xy=0\n$$\n\nis a second-order linear ODE with $a(x)=2,b(x)={x}^{3},c(x)=2x,$ and $f(x)=0.$\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+x{y}^{′}=x{e}^{x}\n$$\n\nis a second-order linear ODE with $a(x)=1,b(x)=x,c(x)=0,$ and $f(x)=x{e}^{x}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388434 13194139536197 true] [17592186388433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388435 13194139536197 true] [17592186388433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388436 13194139536197 true] [17592186388433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388437 13194139536197 true] [17592186388433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388438 13194139536197 true] [17592186388433 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536197 true] [17592186388433 1041 "selection" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388433 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388434 13194139536197 true] [17592186388433 1110 #uuid "959ce921-7783-5c1a-980d-e31ebfae0671" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388434 1034 "II and III only" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388434 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536197 true] [17592186388434 1111 #uuid "0d426fd3-3a43-565b-a3a6-9730a1480e0b" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388435 1034 "I and III only" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388435 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536197 true] [17592186388435 1111 #uuid "ca0c1bc8-571d-588d-b7a1-a8049bb9dbef" 13194139536197 true] [17592186388436 1